    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: warm volcanic regions.\n\nDragon's breath reed grows around volcanic pools in clusters of scarlet, hollow stems. Each joint contains a resinous membrane that crackles when the reed is flexed and exhales a thread of hot smoke when pierced. The dried reed is burned in a shallow cup and its fierce vapour inhaled with care, warming the lungs until every breath tastes of ash. The next successful weapon or unarmed Strike you make within 1-minute deals an additional 1d6 fire damage. The dose is then expended.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
